.SH DATABASE COLLECTIONS
Users, VendorIssues, Investigations, RiskAssessments, Resolutions, Notifications, AuditLogs, and ComplianceCases.
.SH DELIVERY STATUS
The local project runs end to end with seeded MongoDB data. Backend and frontend builds pass. The Compliance Hub covers all six requested domains with shared intake, filtering, severity, confidentiality, anonymous reporting, ownership, and audit events.
.PP
Before production, add SSO/SAML, adaptive password hashing, automated tests, malware-scanned file uploads, advanced case permissions, vendor due diligence, employee training and attestations, regulatory reporting, backups, monitoring, and deployment infrastructure.
